TEXT,H4,H421a-01-05272-10477,"See Schedule A Line 15 of 2002 12 Day report - Refund was allocable from 9/25/2000",""
TEXT,F3XA,,"The Kentucky Democratic Party is in receipt of your letter of November 26 2003 regarding the committee's 2003 May Monthly report.  Memo Schedule A's that itemize the Kentucky Democratic Parties share of the gross contributions received through the joint fundraising activities from the ASDC (Association of State Democratic Chairs) are reported on the amended July Monthly Report.   -    Non-disclosure of salary or wages on Schedule B supporting Line 30(b) please note that the no employee of the committee spent more than 25% of their time during this month working on any Federal Election Activity or activities in connection with a Federal Election. Therefore salary payments were reported on Schedule B for line 21b.    -     Clarification regarding administrative expenses  all administrative expenses incurred for the period have been appropriately disclosed.  The Kentucky Democratic Party does not have any payments for rent or mortgage because the committee owns the property.    ",
